   "subtitle": "Build the modern lab-testing platform for consumers with Ruby on Rails, as a full stack engineer at an early-stage US startup.",
   "description": "<h3>About Sierra Studio</h3>\n<p>When you apply to Sierra, you join an ecosystem. We specialize in connecting talented Brazilian professionals with exciting career opportunities in a highly-vetted small community of growing companies in the US. Applying to Sierra seamlessly integrates you into this ecosystem, granting automatic eligibility for all relevant opportunities we offer.</p>\n<h3>About our hiring partner</h3>\n<p>Our hiring partner is building the modern platform for lab testing, starting with consumer goods brands. They help companies test more cheaply and quickly, and enable them to use lab results to automate regulatory compliance and grow revenue.</p>\n<p>They believe consumers deserve to know the purity and accuracy of every product that affects their families' health. Improving our food system starts with increasing transparency and creating a more informed customer. Not only are they building a lab that makes testing faster, cheaper, and easier, but also the infrastructure that allows brands to:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Market and highlight their lab results by making it easy to push lab data directly to product display pages. Here, brands will highlight what's in their product (",
